--- !u!114 &248119209
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 248119208}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c93c67fb600cec54084b8c85bd7d2db7, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JerryLevelHelp
  stalledSeconds: 35
  deathsBeforeHelp: 5
  player: {fileID: 986871450}
  puzzleButtons:
  - {fileID: 1942540367}
  - {fileID: 1599292383}
  checkpoint: {fileID: 0}
  progressLandings:
  - {fileID: 328873664}
  steps:
  - title: Prepare a corpse over the hatch
    instructions: Jump from the left platforms into the spike beside the central
      wall. Leave a corpse above the horizontal hatch, then return after respawning.
    targets:
    - target: {fileID: 1854765408}
      localOffset: {x: -0.0000004917383, y: 0.1443458, z: 0}
      caption: Leave a corpse here
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.83, b: 0.4, a: 1}
    - target: {fileID: 150294762}
      localOffset: {x: 0, y: -0.00000045881487, z: 0}
      caption: Hatch below the corpse
      color: {r: 0.32895, g: 0.74078476, b: 0.86, a: 1}
  - title: Open the blue hatch
    instructions: Stand on the BLUE button and switch to BLUE. This opens the horizontal
      hatch below the corpse. Keep standing on the button.
    targets:
    - target: {fileID: 1942540370}
      localOffset: {x: 0, y: -0.4137281, z: 0}
      caption: Stand here in BLUE
      color: {r: 0.32895, g: 0.74078476, b: 0.86, a: 1}
    - target: {fileID: 150294762}
      localOffset: {x: 0, y: -0.00000045881487, z: 0}
      caption: Blue hatch opens
      color: {r: 0.32895, g: 0.74078476, b: 0.86, a: 1}
  - title: Release while holding the blue button
    instructions: Hold the BLUE button. Bright corners mark ALL corpses E will drop.
      Keep the upper corpse marked, press E, and stay BLUE until a corpse lands on
      the lower RED button.
    targets:
    - target: {fileID: 1942540370}
      localOffset: {x: 0, y: -0.4137281, z: 0}
      caption: Hold BLUE here
      color: {r: 0.32895, g: 0.74078476, b: 0.86, a: 1}
    - target: {fileID: 1007205080449415711}
      localOffset: {x: 0, y: -0.413729, z: 0}
      caption: Corpse lands here
      color: {r: 0.86, g: 0.35826322, b: 0.3063594, a: 1}
  - title: Switch back to red
    instructions: Once the corpse rests on the lower button, switch to RED. The corpse
      now holds the red gate open. The blue hatch closes again; keep RED while crossing.
    targets:
    - target: {fileID: 1007205080449415711}
      localOffset: {x: 0, y: -0.413729, z: 0}
      caption: Corpse + RED
      color: {r: 0.86, g: 0.35826322, b: 0.3063594, a: 1}
    - target: {fileID: 388235742}
      localOffset: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
      caption: Red gate opens
      color: {r: 0.86, g: 0.35826322, b: 0.3063594, a: 1}
    - target: {fileID: 150294762}
      localOffset: {x: 0, y: -0.00000045881487, z: 0}
      caption: Closed blue hatch
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.83, b: 0.4, a: 1}
  - title: Cross to the exit
    instructions: Drop below the closed blue hatch and pass through the open RED
      gate. Use the right-side platform to jump up to the green exit, keeping RED
      active.
    targets:
    - target: {fileID: 388235742}
      localOffset: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
      caption: Pass below the hatch
      color: {r: 0.86, g: 0.35826322, b: 0.3063594, a: 1}
    - target: {fileID: 1791554636}
      localOffset: {x: 0, y: 1.4817947, z: 0}
      caption: Right-side platform
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.83, b: 0.4, a: 1}
    - target: {fileID: 756701002}
      localOffset: {x: -0.0000003426973, y: 0, z: -0.0000000044902575}
      caption: Exit
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.83, b: 0.4, a: 1}
